      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 5.69,
          "en": "So what is Angular and why would you use it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "Well, Angular is actually two things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 13.23,
          "en": "First and most importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.23,
          "end": 16.92,
          "en": "it's a front-end Java script framework,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.92,
          "end": 21.92,
          "en": "which means it's collection of packages and rules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.02,
          "end": 25.29,
          "en": "you could say, that you should follow when using it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.29,
          "end": 28.56,
          "en": "that help you build advanced, feature-rich,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.56,
          "end": 32.88,
          "en": "and highly interactive web user interfaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.88,
          "end": 36.21,
          "en": "And Angular simply makes that process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.21,
          "end": 39.84,
          "en": "of building such user interfaces simpler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 39.84,
          "end": 43.65,
          "en": "and easier than it would be if you would be using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 43.65,
          "end": 47.97,
          "en": "just JavaScript without a framework like Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 47.97,
          "end": 52.86,
          "en": "And I'll get back to how it does that in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 52.86,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "But Angular is actually not just this framework part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 60.45,
          "en": "even though that's the most important part of Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 63.81,
          "en": "but it's actually also a collection of tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 66.75,
          "en": "that come together with that framework",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 66.75,
          "end": 69.72,
          "en": "and a collection of extra features you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 69.72,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "as a web developer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 75.15,
          "en": "For example, a command line interface that helps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 75.15,
          "end": 77.82,
          "en": "with creating Angular projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.82,
          "end": 79.89,
          "en": "and spinning up development servers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.89,
          "end": 84.42,
          "en": "to preview those projects, but also extra debugging tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.42,
          "end": 87.3,
          "en": "plugins for IDEs and code editors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.3,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "to enhance the development experience, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 95.31,
          "en": "And with that framework and those extra tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.31,
          "end": 98.85,
          "en": "and features, you therefore have a platform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 101.55,
          "en": "on which you can build up to build anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.55,
          "end": 104.19,
          "en": "from basic trivial, all the way up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 107.913,
          "en": "to complex enterprise level web applications.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
